WEBVTT

00:16.550 --> 00:20.150
<b>Your eyes that look far
off into the distance</b>

00:20.150 --> 00:23.790
<b>They're listening to the
voice within your heart</b>

00:23.790 --> 00:27.780
<b>Embracing a still blue moon</b>

00:31.130 --> 00:34.700
<b>Your strength to keep on running</b>

00:34.700 --> 00:38.370
<b>Will open another new door for you</b>

00:38.370 --> 00:42.330
<b>Illuminate the night
that dawns too soon</b>

00:45.670 --> 00:52.910
<b>Even alone, I want to keep
on believing in you</b>

00:52.910 --> 01:00.190
<b>It's in such a moment that
this world will begin to stir</b>

01:00.190 --> 01:03.860
<b>What should we be searching for?</b>

01:03.860 --> 01:07.460
<b>Send out your soul</b>

01:07.460 --> 01:14.740
<b>We'll meet here again
someday, if that's the truth</b>

01:14.740 --> 01:18.370
<b>What should we fix our gaze upon?</b>

01:18.370 --> 01:25.110
<b>The reality that I reached
out and grabbed with my hand</b>

01:25.110 --> 01:28.880
<b>Let it go, Let's believe in it</b>

02:10.330 --> 02:12.760
<b>Man, what a pitiful excuse for a town.</b>

02:12.760 --> 02:15.600
<b>You think we'll actually find
something to eat here?</b>

02:15.600 --> 02:19.160
<b>More importantly, does that castle in
the distance bother anyone else?</b>

02:21.770 --> 02:23.740
<b>What are they doing over there?</b>

02:23.740 --> 02:26.880
<b>I don't know. It seems to be
some kind of ceremony.</b>

02:26.880 --> 02:30.150
<b>Maybe they'll start up a bon
dance at night or something.</b>

02:30.150 --> 02:32.650
<b>What?! Then you think they'll
have food stands too?!</b>

02:32.650 --> 02:34.480
<b>I wanna have some fried noodles!</b>

02:34.480 --> 02:36.380
<b>Like hell they will!</b>

02:36.380 --> 02:38.980
<b>You people must be outsiders.</b>

02:41.020 --> 02:44.060
<b>It's true. We're travelers.</b>

02:44.060 --> 02:46.830
<b>Hey, what's that procession for?</b>

02:46.830 --> 02:50.290
<b>It's a final farewell ceremony
for the sacrifice.</b>

02:51.330 --> 02:52.970
<b>Sacrifice?!</b>

02:52.970 --> 02:55.370
<b>You see that castle over there?</b>

02:55.370 --> 02:58.270
<b>Every year, this town
offers a sacrifice</b>

02:58.270 --> 03:00.940
<b>to the demon who
dwells in that castle.</b>

03:00.940 --> 03:02.140
<b>What the heck is up with that?</b>

03:02.140 --> 03:05.350
<b>That's not very fashionable
these days, is it?</b>

03:05.350 --> 03:08.380
<b>Surely you can see
that large cannon.</b>

03:08.380 --> 03:13.150
<b>They have the ability to wipe
us out in the blink of an eye.</b>

03:13.150 --> 03:15.760
<b>You can see we have no
choice but to do as they say.</b>

03:15.760 --> 03:18.260
<b>Then why don't you just move away?</b>

03:18.260 --> 03:20.250
<b>It's water, isn't it?</b>

03:21.160 --> 03:24.630
<b>It isn't possible to even contemplate
moving without water.</b>

03:24.630 --> 03:26.430
<b>The desert surrounds us on all sides,</b>

03:26.430 --> 03:29.040
<b>and they have control of
our water source.</b>

03:29.040 --> 03:31.270
<b>And that giant cannon
on top of that.</b>

03:31.270 --> 03:32.940
<b>This town's like a prison</b>

03:32.940 --> 03:36.710
<b>surrounded by many layers
of invisible walls.</b>

03:36.710 --> 03:40.480
<b>That's so stupid! You could
just get rid of that demon.</b>

04:05.570 --> 04:07.040
<b>Kanan...</b>

04:19.920 --> 04:21.650
<b>Farewell, Gonou.</b>

04:22.460 --> 04:25.820
<b>Hakkai! Hakkai, what's wrong?</b>

04:36.240 --> 04:39.400
<b>I'm sorry, but I have no intention
of letting you go any further.</b>

04:40.240 --> 04:42.640
<b>Please stop this idiocy right now.</b>

04:48.580 --> 04:52.320
<b>I don't even want to know
what you're thinking,</b>

04:52.320 --> 04:53.990
<b>but I believe I'm painfully aware</b>

04:53.990 --> 04:56.590
<b>of how a sacrifice's friends
and relatives feel.</b>

04:56.590 --> 04:59.080
<b>You bastard! Get out of
the way! Or else!</b>

05:00.300 --> 05:01.760
<b>Or else what?</b>

05:02.430 --> 05:03.900
<b>Get him!</b>

05:10.240 --> 05:13.870
<b>That's enough. Bring out
the person in charge.</b>

05:16.710 --> 05:21.280
<b>I see. I understand very well
what you're trying to say.</b>

05:21.280 --> 05:22.320
<b>Then...</b>

05:22.320 --> 05:23.980
<b>My answer is no.</b>

05:24.790 --> 05:26.890
<b>I knew he'd say that.</b>

05:26.890 --> 05:29.950
<b>He's totally possessed
by the spirit of a loser.</b>

05:30.790 --> 05:32.560
<b>Your reason?</b>

05:32.560 --> 05:36.300
<b>Houfa voluntarily
accepted the role.</b>

05:36.300 --> 05:41.040
<b>I appreciate your sentiments,
but I can't endanger the lives</b>

05:41.040 --> 05:46.740
<b>of everyone living in this
town on your whim alone.</b>

05:46.740 --> 05:48.340
<b>Please understand.</b>

05:48.340 --> 05:52.480
<b>I have an obligation to protect
the townspeople here.</b>

05:52.480 --> 05:54.570
<b>I've heard quite enough.</b>

05:56.220 --> 05:58.620
<b>What all of you are doing is wrong!</b>

05:59.320 --> 06:04.790
<b>It's never all right to sacrifice one
of your own to save yourselves!</b>

06:04.790 --> 06:07.930
<b>I'm only thinking of
the townspeople.</b>

06:07.930 --> 06:10.070
<b>You still don't get it?!</b>

06:10.070 --> 06:12.560
<b>You speak of protecting
all the townspeople,</b>

06:14.640 --> 06:18.370
<b>and yet you're sending her, a
townswoman, to her death!</b>

06:18.370 --> 06:22.240
<b>You bastard! Don't talk like
you know everything!</b>

06:22.240 --> 06:27.980
<b>I don't want to hand over Houfa,
my fiancée, to a monster either!</b>

06:27.980 --> 06:32.990
<b>But... But I've got no choice.
They're incredibly strong.</b>

06:32.990 --> 06:35.590
<b>No human could ever stand
a chance against them.</b>

06:35.590 --> 06:39.650
<b>That's why... We're all just
desperately trying to stay alive!</b>

06:40.800 --> 06:43.500
<b>Alive? You don't protect
your loved ones,</b>

06:43.500 --> 06:45.500
<b>and you wag your tail to the enemy.</b>

06:45.500 --> 06:47.700
<b>Do you really call that being alive?</b>

06:49.340 --> 06:50.470
<b>You bastard!</b>

06:50.470 --> 06:51.930
<b>Stop it!</b>

06:54.940 --> 06:57.310
<b>Please, stop it already.</b>

07:04.390 --> 07:08.380
<b>Hey, Hakkai, what's the matter?
This isn't like you.</b>

07:10.090 --> 07:11.930
<b>Hey, Hakkai!</b>

07:11.930 --> 07:13.730
<b>Shut your mouth, you bratty monkey.</b>

07:13.730 --> 07:14.830
<b>What'd you call me?!</b>

07:14.830 --> 07:18.800
<b>Grown-ups have their own
deep circumstances.</b>

07:18.800 --> 07:20.900
<b>Circumstances? What's that?</b>

07:20.900 --> 07:23.170
<b>It means you should shut your trap.</b>

07:23.170 --> 07:25.300
<b>What's with you too, Sanzo?</b>

07:26.110 --> 07:30.200
<b>It's true that Goku's right.
This isn't like me, is it?</b>

07:31.180 --> 07:32.650
<b>Hakkai...</b>

07:34.750 --> 07:36.220
<b>She looked...</b>

07:37.220 --> 07:38.690
<b>...like Kanan.</b>

07:43.490 --> 07:44.960
<b>Kanan?</b>

07:45.690 --> 07:47.590
<b>So, what're you going to do?</b>

07:49.430 --> 07:52.130
<b>You've got some interesting
idea, right?</b>

07:52.970 --> 07:54.700
<b>Count me in.</b>

07:54.700 --> 07:56.170
<b>Me too! Me too!</b>

07:58.410 --> 07:59.870
<b>Everyone...</b>

08:00.610 --> 08:03.100
<b>You really seem to be enjoying this.</b>

08:26.630 --> 08:28.100
<b>Houfa...</b>

08:31.710 --> 08:33.170
<b>Well...</b>

09:01.370 --> 09:02.800
<b>Isn't it chilly tonight?</b>

09:04.510 --> 09:07.440
<b>You have no need of
something so dangerous.</b>

09:09.940 --> 09:13.350
<b>Miss Houfa, I realize it's sudden,
but please run.</b>

09:14.620 --> 09:16.450
<b>I can't.</b>

09:16.450 --> 09:19.450
<b>If I run, then someone
else will be...</b>

09:19.450 --> 09:22.560
<b>Don't worry. I thought
you might say that,</b>

09:22.560 --> 09:24.650
<b>so I worked out a plan
before I came here.</b>

09:25.830 --> 09:29.920
<b>You're not a member of this town.
I can't let you get involved.</b>

09:30.470 --> 09:34.200
<b>Besides, I don't intend to go
down without a fight either.</b>

09:34.200 --> 09:38.040
<b>Don't say that. Please trust us.</b>

09:38.040 --> 09:40.940
<b>It'll be more certain than for you
to do something on your own.</b>

09:40.940 --> 09:42.340
<b>But...</b>

09:42.340 --> 09:47.650
<b>We might not look it, but we're
actually pretty strong you know.</b>

09:47.650 --> 09:49.880
<b>Why're you doing this
for someone like me?</b>

09:49.880 --> 09:51.790
<b>Please don't let it bother you.</b>

09:51.790 --> 09:54.260
<b>It's just something I'm
doing because I want to.</b>

09:54.260 --> 09:57.190
<b>I can't possibly let you!</b>

09:57.190 --> 09:58.750
<b>Oh, boy...</b>

10:00.030 --> 10:03.560
<b>Something similar happened
once, you see.</b>

10:05.830 --> 10:11.370
<b>That time, I wasn't able to save her,</b>

10:11.370 --> 10:14.840
<b>all because my powers
weren't sufficient.</b>

10:14.840 --> 10:16.280
<b>That's why...</b>

10:17.610 --> 10:20.110
<b>I'm sorry. I had no idea.</b>

10:20.110 --> 10:25.480
<b>Oh, no. But you see, this
is just my ego, so you...</b>

10:31.490 --> 10:34.930
<b>I don't understand such
complicated things.</b>

10:34.930 --> 10:36.950
<b>But there's one thing I do know.</b>

10:38.900 --> 10:41.630
<b>You've saved me.</b>

10:45.170 --> 10:46.640
<b>Kanan...</b>

10:52.550 --> 10:57.090
<b>By the way, Miss Houfa, are
you good at cooking?</b>

10:57.090 --> 10:58.590
<b>Yes...</b>

10:58.590 --> 11:00.250
<b>I'm glad to hear that!</b>

11:00.250 --> 11:04.260
<b>We actually haven't had much
to eat these last couple days,</b>

11:04.260 --> 11:08.260
<b>so when it's all over, would
you be so kind as to feed us?</b>

11:08.260 --> 11:09.920
<b>Yes, gladly!</b>

11:10.470 --> 11:11.930
<b>I want fried noodles!</b>

11:12.570 --> 11:14.970
<b>You stinking monkey,
you blew our cover!</b>

11:14.970 --> 11:16.440
<b>Kill him!</b>

11:19.410 --> 11:20.870
<b>Well, there you have it.</b>

11:23.950 --> 11:25.410
<b>I understand.</b>

11:27.750 --> 11:31.690
<b>I'll never allow the same
mistake to be made again!</b>

12:17.500 --> 12:18.970
<b>Now, then...</b>

12:35.820 --> 12:37.280
<b>So, she's arrived.</b>

12:41.890 --> 12:45.660
<b>Hey, I hear the sacrifice
is a real beauty this time.</b>

12:45.660 --> 12:49.430
<b>Does it matter? It's not like
she's going to be our toy.</b>

12:50.130 --> 12:51.600
<b>You got that right.</b>

12:55.900 --> 12:57.610
<b>Who the hell are they?!</b>

12:57.610 --> 12:59.040
<b>What's wrong?</b>

12:59.670 --> 13:02.310
<b>A scripture draped across
his shoulders</b>

13:02.310 --> 13:03.780
<b>and a crimson chakra...</b>

13:04.880 --> 13:07.940
<b>He's Genjo Sanzo!</b>

13:10.350 --> 13:13.950
<b>I've been looking forward
to this moment, little lady.</b>

13:18.860 --> 13:21.760
<b>What an ample welcome.</b>

13:21.760 --> 13:25.200
<b>I'd guess roughly one hundred men.</b>

13:25.200 --> 13:27.260
<b>Awesome! Awesome!</b>

13:27.900 --> 13:29.370
<b>Good grief.</b>

13:33.610 --> 13:39.740
<b>Now, little lady, let's have a good
look at your darling face.</b>

13:45.950 --> 13:48.420
<b>Hello, I'm sorry it's such a
predictable turn of events.</b>

13:49.620 --> 13:54.120
<b>But I thought this would be the
best way for me to meet you.</b>

13:54.800 --> 13:57.970
<b>And none of you think anything of it?!</b>

13:57.970 --> 14:01.040
<b>Those people aren't of this town!</b>

14:01.040 --> 14:03.500
<b>I know what you're saying, but...</b>

14:03.500 --> 14:05.130
<b>They're probably already dead by now.</b>

14:17.750 --> 14:23.590
<b>This is a problem. If we can't prove
they have nothing to do with us...</b>

14:23.590 --> 14:26.460
<b>I've heard enough! I'll go, even
if I have to go alone!</b>

14:28.900 --> 14:30.360
<b>Hold on.</b>

14:37.200 --> 14:39.200
<b>I better show off my good side too.</b>

14:41.780 --> 14:46.340
<b>Too soft! Barging in here with
just that level of power...</b>

14:47.010 --> 14:51.420
<b>Very well, know the awesome might
of my powers!</b>

14:56.390 --> 14:59.380
<b>Well, well, they sure are going at it.</b>

15:01.130 --> 15:02.600
<b>Now, then...</b>

15:03.830 --> 15:08.270
<b>Gojyo, I'd like to ask you
to destroy the battery.</b>

15:08.270 --> 15:11.470
<b>This is a stealth mission, so
please approach the battery</b>

15:11.470 --> 15:13.300
<b>without being noticed
as much as possible.</b>

15:14.040 --> 15:16.840
<b>I get noticed even when I
don't say anything though.</b>

15:17.910 --> 15:22.440
<b>Sanzo and Goku, forgive me, but
you two will act as decoys.</b>

15:23.550 --> 15:26.190
<b>When they see that a Sanzo
has come to storm the castle,</b>

15:26.190 --> 15:29.350
<b>they won't have time to think of
firing the cannon at the town.</b>

15:33.530 --> 15:35.830
<b>Damn it, what a sketchy plan.</b>

15:39.730 --> 15:42.040
<b>Sanzo, how many did you get so far?</b>

15:42.040 --> 15:43.600
<b>That one was eighteen.</b>

15:43.600 --> 15:45.840
<b>I win! I got twenty!</b>

15:45.840 --> 15:49.010
<b>That leaves sixty! Don't let
your guard down!</b>

15:49.010 --> 15:50.480
<b>Sanzo, you too!</b>

16:01.820 --> 16:05.090
<b>Well, then, guess I'll make
short work of this thing.</b>

16:05.090 --> 16:07.080
<b>Whoops, not so fast.</b>

16:12.770 --> 16:14.740
<b>You guys are too soft.</b>

16:14.740 --> 16:16.770
<b>If you make a big ruckus
like that outside,</b>

16:16.770 --> 16:19.240
<b>almost anyone would
notice it's a diversion.</b>

16:20.140 --> 16:22.040
<b>It's too bad.</b>

16:22.040 --> 16:25.110
<b>You're making a terrible mistake.</b>

16:25.110 --> 16:26.380
<b>What're you talking about?</b>

16:26.380 --> 16:30.320
<b>I'm saying you can't
defeat me by yourself.</b>

16:30.320 --> 16:32.250
<b>Well, we'll see about that!</b>

16:36.220 --> 16:38.830
<b>What's the matter? You
worn out already?</b>

16:38.830 --> 16:43.330
<b>But I'm too hungry to put
strength into it anymore.</b>

16:43.330 --> 16:45.160
<b>I'm going to kill you.</b>

17:02.220 --> 17:03.420
<b>Highness!</b>

17:03.420 --> 17:04.290
<b>Who is that?!</b>

17:04.290 --> 17:07.520
<b>You guys, blow that town away
to teach them a lesson!</b>

17:07.520 --> 17:08.990
<b>Damn it...</b>

17:11.760 --> 17:13.360
<b>I'm not letting you get away.</b>

17:13.360 --> 17:14.880
<b>Who the hell's trying to get away?!</b>

17:15.560 --> 17:18.130
<b>Highness, everything's ready!</b>

17:18.130 --> 17:19.790
<b>All right, do it!</b>

17:27.010 --> 17:28.780
<b>Yo, longhair.</b>

17:28.780 --> 17:30.750
<b>You guys! Why...</b>

17:30.750 --> 17:34.680
<b>To prove that we're
alive too, of course!</b>

17:37.250 --> 17:41.160
<b>This isn't a game, damn it!
I'm going to kill all of you!</b>

17:41.160 --> 17:44.280
<b>I told you you're not
capable of that already!</b>

17:47.860 --> 17:50.190
<b>Moron! Where do you think
you're throwing that?!</b>

17:57.810 --> 18:01.710
<b>I told you, didn't I? That you
wouldn't be able to do it.</b>

18:21.260 --> 18:23.860
<b>All that's left is you, Hakkai.</b>

18:26.200 --> 18:29.000
<b>What's the matter?!
Finished already, boy?!</b>

18:32.670 --> 18:34.710
<b>It seems your hearing is good.</b>

18:34.710 --> 18:35.910
<b>What?!</b>

18:35.910 --> 18:38.810
<b>That sound was the cannon
being destroyed.</b>

18:38.810 --> 18:41.420
<b>Those voices belong
to the townspeople.</b>

18:41.420 --> 18:43.450
<b>The symbol of your rule
has been shattered,</b>

18:43.450 --> 18:45.320
<b>and the people have stood up.</b>

18:46.120 --> 18:48.780
<b>All that remains is you!</b>

18:50.390 --> 18:52.990
<b>Impertinence! I'll kill
every last one of you!</b>

18:57.230 --> 18:58.700
<b>Die!</b>

19:08.740 --> 19:10.850
<b>You're wasting your time!</b>

19:10.850 --> 19:13.550
<b>I was waiting for this moment!</b>

19:13.550 --> 19:16.140
<b>This is the end!</b>

19:26.460 --> 19:30.830
<b>Thank you so very much. I
don't know how to repay you.</b>

19:30.830 --> 19:34.970
<b>Perhaps we had become too
accustomed to obeying.</b>

19:34.970 --> 19:37.970
<b>You took way too long to realize that.</b>

19:37.970 --> 19:39.570
<b>If you've got time to repent,</b>

19:39.570 --> 19:42.300
<b>then use it to think about how
to stand on your own two feet.</b>

19:43.310 --> 19:46.610
<b>You took so much damage
fighting for us.</b>

19:48.550 --> 19:50.020
<b>But...</b>

19:50.580 --> 19:53.090
<b>I'm so glad you're safe.</b>

19:53.090 --> 19:56.610
<b>Well, he was actually rather
unexpectedly strong.</b>

19:57.360 --> 19:59.260
<b>Thanks to you, my eyes are open now.</b>

19:59.990 --> 20:03.790
<b>You showed us that you have
to make your own destiny.</b>

20:04.600 --> 20:07.760
<b>And that you should protect your
loved ones with your own hands.</b>

20:12.540 --> 20:14.010
<b>Miss!</b>

20:15.240 --> 20:17.610
<b>I'm starving!</b>

20:17.610 --> 20:19.080
<b>Food!</b>

20:21.580 --> 20:23.950
<b>You're way too gluttonous,
you stinking monkey!</b>

20:24.590 --> 20:28.490
<b>All right. I'll start cooking
as soon as we get back.</b>

20:28.490 --> 20:31.260
<b>Yes! Fried noodles, fried noodles!</b>

20:31.260 --> 20:34.660
<b>Fried monkey? That'd be cannibalism.</b>

20:34.660 --> 20:37.030
<b>Did you say something,
pervy water sprite?!</b>

20:37.030 --> 20:38.570
<b>What? You wanna go at it?!</b>

20:38.570 --> 20:39.470
<b>All right!</b>

20:39.470 --> 20:41.200
<b>Come and get me, fried monkey!</b>

20:41.200 --> 20:42.930
<b>Enough is enough!</b>

20:45.870 --> 20:52.280
<b>That's right, even sudden
tragedies come</b>

20:52.280 --> 20:57.650
<b>Looking good-natured, without
cause for suspicion</b>

20:57.650 --> 21:03.160
<b>Don't complain, just shut up</b>

21:03.160 --> 21:06.560
<b>And look up</b>

21:06.560 --> 21:12.370
<b>I'll stay in character no matter
how ordinary the scene is</b>

21:12.370 --> 21:17.770
<b>Before any talk of dreams or hopes</b>

21:17.770 --> 21:23.110
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

21:23.110 --> 21:27.050
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:34.050 --> 21:37.690
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:37.690 --> 21:39.660
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:39.660 --> 21:43.760
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:43.760 --> 21:47.900
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:47.900 --> 21:50.570
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:50.570 --> 21:55.640
<b>Standing next to the taut pressure</b>

21:55.640 --> 22:01.050
<b>I'll laugh more boldly and
fearlessly than anyone</b>

22:01.050 --> 22:06.490
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

22:06.490 --> 22:10.510
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>
